  triage:description "quality-mgr's PR #1242 QA verdict (arch-qa): crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/writer/mod.rs is ~1562 non-test lines after SerialWriterQueue was folded in alongside the existing batch/diagnostics/shutdown pipeline, over the 1000-line decomposition cap (rated important not blocking). Acceptance: extract the batch-processing pipeline (writer_loop, process_batch, process_message_admission_group, process_queued_write) into a new crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/writer/batch.rs module, re-exported from writer/mod.rs, bringing writer/mod.rs back under the 1000-line cap with no behavior change." ;
